# ultrawidelock_anchor role: everything CONFIG_ULTRAWIDELOCK_ANCHOR compiles unconditionally --
# door swing geometry, two-anchor fusion, the side-of-door gate and its log,
# the satellite protocol half, the SLAM estimator and the report formatter.
# Integer arithmetic over caller-owned structs, so it links anywhere.
# Consumers: modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/CMakeLists.txt,
# ports/esp32/components/ultrawidelock_anchor, tests/host/sources.sh.
# One repo-root-relative path per line, sorted; add HERE and nowhere else.
modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/src/ultrawidelock_door.c
modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/src/ultrawidelock_fusion.c
modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/src/ultrawidelock_report.c
modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/src/ultrawidelock_satellite.c
modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/src/ultrawidelock_side.c
modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/src/ultrawidelock_side_log.c
modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/src/ultrawidelock_slam.c
